  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nx = 6/5\n\nNumbers: 6x, 37/6, 6 - x, 5 + x\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n6x = 6 × (6/5) = 36/5 = 7.2\n\n6 - x = 6 - (6/5) = (30/5) - (6/5) = 24/5 = 4.8\n\n5 + x = 5 + (6/5) = (25/5) + (6/5) = 31/5 = 6.2\n\n37/6 = 6.1666...\n\nThe numbers are in ascending order:\n\n4.8 < 6.1666... < 6.2 < 7.2\n\n24/5 < 37/6 < 31/5 < 36/5\n\n6 - x < 37/6 < 5 + x < 6x\n\n**∴ The ascending order is: 6 - x, 37/6, 5 + x, 6x.**",
